<title>UK: London silver fixes just firmer at 435.90 cents.</title>
<headline>London silver fixes just firmer at 435.90 cents.</headline>
<text>
<p>SILVER - Fixes at 435.90 cents versus 434.50 cents on Thursday. Following gold.</p>
<p>GOLD - Eases back from firmer AM. Up 30 cents at $319.70/$320.10. Consolidating but sentiment very bearish longer term.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Firmer at $402.50/$405.50, versus Thursday's close of $396.00/$400.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Just higher at $163.00/$167.00.</p>
</text>
